    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal base class for XTC tasks using modern Gradle best practices: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>Constructor injection for services - avoids this-escape issues </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Configuration cache compatible - no Project references at execution time </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Lazy property evaluation - configured by plugin, evaluated at execution </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>Minimal API surface - protected fields for subclass access </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>This base class provides common services as protected fields. Most tasks should extend DefaultTask directly unless they need these specific utilities. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
